/**
 * How Mountain-and-valley snow ring (`yamatani-no-yukiwa`) is constructed, in a line in each language: the text a crest's card shows beside its steps.
 * It is here, not on the crest's record, so that the manifest stays small; `crestConstruction()` loads it.
 *
 * @example
 * ```ts no-run
 * import { description } from "@johnmorrisdotca/kamon-crests/steps/yamatani-no-yukiwa";
 *
 * console.log(description.en.length > 30, description.ja.endsWith("。")); // true true
 * ```
 */
const description: { en: string; ja: string } = {"en":"Six lozenges meet at the middle and make a six-pointed star, with points to the left and right. A small lozenge stands beyond each point. Over each notch of the star stands a broad jagged leaf that fills the band out to the layout circle: a body of two circles with seven pointed teeth round its outer half, three of them at the tip, and a short foot that narrows towards the notch. Each tooth is two equal bowed arcs from the body to a point. The six leaves, the six lozenges and the six small lozenges are each one unit turned a sixth of a turn at a time.","ja":"六つの菱を中央で合わせて、左右に先の向く六つの角の星を作ります。それぞれの角の先に、小さな菱を一つ置きます。星のへこみごとに、外の円まで届く幅の広いぎざぎざの葉を一枚立てます。葉は、二つの円で作る胴の外側半分に、とがった歯を七つつけ、そのうち三つを先に置き、根元はへこみに向かって細くします。歯はどれも、胴から先までを同じ二本の弧で描きます。六枚の葉、六つの菱、六つの小さな菱は、それぞれ一つを作って6分の1回転ずつ回します。"};

export default construction;
export { construction, description };
